  "name": "1985 Japanese Sablefish Tagging Survey",
  "description": "Alaska sablefish tagging data, consisting of release and recovery sizes and the length of time fish were at liberty, provide an independent estimate of growth rates. The vessel was named Fukuyoshi Maru No. 8 (Japan).\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Primarily to provide resource assessment estimates to management.",
